D3-ONNX-CPU

This repository converts the Decision 3.0 models d3-edge, d3-lite, d3-nano and d3-mini of the vLLM Semantic Router Team
(https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr) to ONNX and provides a minimal-dependency inference implementation for them. The ONNX files
(released separately, not stored in this repository) are derivative works of those checkpoints:

  - exported from the checkpoints at the revisions pinned in export/models.py (the weights are converted from bf16 to fp32 without
    other change; the readout matrix is folded into the decoder graph; the attention masks the vendor's runtime adds with a forward
    hook are built inside the graph; the decoder is exported once per fixed sequence length with the weights shared between them);
  - this repository's source code (d3_decide/, export/, verify/, tests/, demos) is a new implementation, written to reproduce
    the behaviour of the vendor's runtime (d3_runtime.py, d3_format.py), which is not copied here.

